category: Devel
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Gravity Programming Language (utilities)"
ldesc: "Gravity is a powerful, dynamically typed, lightweight, embeddable programming
language written in C without any external dependency (except stdlib). It is a
class based concurrent scripting language with a modern Swift like syntax."
